		"_note": "How painted intensity 1..5 maps to per-kingdom render parameters. Each kingdom's _spawn_<kingdom> helper reads from here. Tuned 2026-05-05 toward Alice-scale — biome reads as surreal/dreamlike rather than miniature-realistic. f5 = ~2.5x baseline flower, t5 = ~2.3x baseline tree, u5 = ~2m mycelium, c5 = ~1.9x baseline creature.",
